Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Recommends: xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-12
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver metapackage (GeForce 2/3/4 Ti series (NV1x, NV2x))
 The 96.43.23 driver from the NVIDIA 96xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for jammy.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce 2/3/4 Ti series (NV1x, NV2x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2012. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 12. High risk.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2204: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (12). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump,
 nvidia-persistenced and the GTK backends for the 96.43.23 driver.



Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-96xx-glx,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 96.43.23 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 96.43.23 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-5.15.0-125-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-5.15.0-125-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-5.15.0-125-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96xx prebuilt module for Linux 5.15.0-125-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 96xx series,
 compiled for the 5.15.0-125-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
